 "remarks": "WELCOME TO SEASIDE LANDING - COVE LIVING AT ITS FINEST! This exceptional 3+ bedroom, 3.5-bath end-unit townhome offers sophisticated living, generous space, and an enviable location near Holly Pond, Cove Beach, and Darien. The light-filled open floor plan features high ceilings, gleaming hardwood floors, and spacious living and dining areas. The gourmet kitchen boasts granite countertops, stainless GE appliances, abundant cabinetry, generous eat-in space, and custom pendant lighting. Sliders from the dining area lead to a private balcony, perfect for morning coffee or entertaining. The second level features a spacious primary suite with walk-in closet and luxurious bath with double sinks, separate shower, and jetted soaking tub, plus a generous second bedroom, full hall bath, and convenient laundry. The expansive third floor offers a versatile private retreat with bedroom/bonus space, full bath, walk-in closet, and additional storage-ideal for guests, office, studio, or family room. Enjoy peaceful morning light and distant Holly Pond views from the upper levels. An oversized attached two-car garage provides exceptional storage, with reserved parking and ample street parking. Low HOA fees include landscaping and snow removal. Minutes to Cove Island Beach, Chelsea Piers, waterfront dining, shopping, boating, Metro-North, I-95, and downtown Stamford. A rare opportunity for spacious, maintenance-free coastal living in one of Stamford's most desirable locations!",
